        <mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;" value="UniConnect – Corrected Career Board Class Diagram" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="20" width="1860" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="user" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«shared reference»&lt;br&gt;User&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- userId : Long&lt;br&gt;- platformRole : PlatformRole&lt;br&gt;- accountStatus : AccountStatus&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="105" width="380" height="225" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="student" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«profile-module reference»&lt;br&gt;StudentProfile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- studentNumber : String&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="110" width="370" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="alumni" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«profile-module reference»&lt;br&gt;AlumniProfile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- graduationYear : Integer&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1830" y="110" width="370" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="skill" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«profile-module reference»&lt;br&gt;Skill&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- skillId : Long&lt;br&gt;- skillName : String {unique}&lt;br&gt;- category : String [0..1]&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2310" y="105" width="370" height="220" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="service" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«domain service»&lt;br&gt;CareerBoardService&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;+ publishPost(alumniId, details)&lt;br&gt;+ updatePost(postId, alumniId, details)&lt;br&gt;+ closePost(postId, alumniId)&lt;br&gt;+ browseActivePosts(studentId, filters, sort)&lt;br&gt;+ viewPost(postId, studentId)&lt;br&gt;+ savePost(postId, studentId, note)&lt;br&gt;+ updateSavedNote(savedJobId, studentId, note)&lt;br&gt;+ unsavePost(postId, studentId)&lt;br&gt;+ openApplicationChannel(postId, studentId)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="420" width="555" height="490" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="job" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;JobPost&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- jobPostId : Long&lt;br&gt;- title : String&lt;br&gt;- companyName : String&lt;br&gt;- description : String&lt;br&gt;- qualifications : String&lt;br&gt;- location : String [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- employmentType : EmploymentType&lt;br&gt;- workMode : WorkMode&lt;br&gt;- salaryRange : String [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- applicationUrl : String [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- applicationEmail : String [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- applicationDeadline : LocalDate&lt;br&gt;- status : JobPostStatus&lt;br&gt;- postedAt : LocalDateTime&lt;br&gt;- updatedAt : LocalDateTime&lt;br&gt;- closedAt : LocalDateTime [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- removedAt : LocalDateTime [0..1]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;+ isExpired(onDate) : boolean&lt;br&gt;+ isActive(onDate) : boolean&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="420" width="540" height="825" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jobSkill" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;JobSkill&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- jobSkillId : Long&lt;br&gt;- required : boolean&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1490" y="500" width="350" height="210" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="saved" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;SavedJob&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- savedJobId : Long&lt;br&gt;- note : String [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- savedAt : LocalDateTime&lt;br&gt;- updatedAt : LocalDateTime [0..1]&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1480" y="850" width="370" height="270" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notification" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«shared reference»&lt;br&gt;Notification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- notificationId : Long&lt;br&gt;- recipient : User&lt;br&gt;- type : NotificationType&lt;br&gt;- eventKey : String&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2040" y="470" width="410" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="moderation" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«administration-module reference»&lt;br&gt;ModerationAction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- actionId : Long&lt;br&gt;- actionType : ActionType&lt;br&gt;- reason : String&lt;br&gt;- createdAt : LocalDateTime&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2040" y="850" width="430" height="270" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="status" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«enumeration»&lt;br&gt;JobPostStatus&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;PUBLISHED&lt;br&gt;CLOSED&lt;br&gt;REMOVED&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="1080" width="300" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="employmentType" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«enumeration»&lt;br&gt;EmploymentType&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;INTERNSHIP&lt;br&gt;PART_TIME&lt;br&gt;FULL_TIME&lt;br&gt;CONTRACT&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="1080" width="300" height="230" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="workMode" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«enumeration»&lt;br&gt;WorkMode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;ONSITE&lt;br&gt;REMOTE&lt;br&gt;HYBRID&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1970" y="1190" width="300" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;" value="&lt;b&gt;Module constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C1. Publishing requires an ACTIVE User with PlatformRole = ALUMNI. No separate alumni-verification flag is stored. Each JobPost has exactly one alumni author.&lt;br&gt;C2. A post requires title, companyName, description, qualifications, employmentType, workMode, applicationDeadline, and at least one valid application channel: applicationUrl or applicationEmail.&lt;br&gt;C3. Only the author may update permitted details or close the post, and only while status = PUBLISHED. Closing sets status = CLOSED and closedAt; no author delete or reopen operation exists in the current requirements.&lt;br&gt;C4. Expiry is time-derived: isExpired(onDate) means applicationDeadline &amp;lt; onDate. EXPIRED is a visible availability label, not a stored JobPostStatus. A scheduled midnight mutation is therefore unnecessary.&lt;br&gt;C5. isActive(onDate) means status = PUBLISHED and not expired. Active browsing, filters, sorting, saving, and opening the external application channel use this rule. Expired, closed, and removed posts are excluded from active browsing.&lt;br&gt;C6. Students may filter active posts by employment type, location, work mode, and skill, and sort by posting date or application deadline. Full details include qualifications, required skills, deadline, and application method.&lt;br&gt;C7. Each JobSkill links one JobPost to one Skill and records whether that skill is required. Duplicate JobSkill rows for the same post/skill pair are prohibited.&lt;br&gt;C8. Only an ACTIVE STUDENT may create SavedJob, and only for a currently active post. At most one SavedJob exists per student/post pair; duplicate saves are rejected.&lt;br&gt;C9. SavedJob remains in the student's saved list after its post closes or expires. The student may update its optional note or unsave it. If moderation removes the post, the bookmark may remain for history but must not expose removed content or permit application.&lt;br&gt;C10. Only an ACTIVE SYSTEM_ADMIN may set status = REMOVED through moderation, with a reason and immutable audit history. Author closure and deadline expiry are not moderation removal.&lt;br&gt;C11. The application itself occurs outside UniConnect through the validated URL or email. UniConnect does not store job applications or applicants in the current scope.&lt;br&gt;C12. Notifications are informational, duplicate events are prevented by eventKey, and no notification grants posting, viewing, saving, or moderation authority." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1460" width="2660" height="570" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

